{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109123","id":2706847211,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6hVzXr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109123","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109123.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109123.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109123","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109123/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109123/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109123/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a32b59622fa3dad52c562915d378e4314b9f5eb9","number":109123,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `Image` nearest and cubic resizing bias","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #109092.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n        # Downscale: 128px -> 21px\r\n\tvar tex:Texture2D = load(\"res://icon.svg\")\r\n\tvar img:=tex.get_image().duplicate()\r\n\timg.resize(21,21,Image.INTERPOLATE_BILINEAR)\r\n\timg.save_png(\"res://tex_bilinear.png\")\r\n\r\n\timg=tex.get_image().duplicate()\r\n\timg.resize(21,21,Image.INTERPOLATE_CUBIC)\r\n\timg.save_png(\"res://tex_cubic.png\")\r\n\r\n\timg=tex.get_image().duplicate()\r\n\timg.resize(21,21,Image.INTERPOLATE_NEAREST)\r\n\timg.save_png(\"res://tex_nearset.png\")\r\n\t\r\n\timg=tex.get_image().duplicate()\r\n\timg.resize(21,21,Image.INTERPOLATE_TRILINEAR)\r\n\timg.save_png(\"res://tex_trilinear.png\")\r\n\r\n\timg=tex.get_image().duplicate()\r\n\timg.resize(21,21,Image.INTERPOLATE_LANCZOS)\r\n\timg.save_png(\"res://tex_lanczos.png\")\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n| - |Nearest | Cubic |\r\n| - | - | - |\r\n|This PR|<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"tex_nearset_d\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b965afde-80d5-45a9-a318-f2cc57be4e95\" />|<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"tex_cubic\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b5e47447-7aef-49b8-80ee-aa25ff5b12b6\" />|\r\n| 4.4 |<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"tex_nearset_d\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9688604-b0c5-45b4-9873-bfe0fab0edc2\" />|<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"tex_cubic_d\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e72537a4-20c9-48d2-8af8-a427187bf13e\" />|\r\n|GIMP|<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"icon_gimp_nearest\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3dacfa43-c243-487c-8ef0-d0a65d0e5dfb\" />|<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"icon_gimp_cubic\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93a452f9-1de1-431a-a47d-f1137caadf16\" />|\r\n\r\nComparison with other algorithms:\r\n| Bilinear| Trilinear| Lanczos|\r\n| - | -| - |\r\n|<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"tex_bilinear\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ca8ac44-6586-4e0f-934a-a6e6e3efe95e\" />|<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"tex_trilinear\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2130f80c-ee21-45e1-ad45-3935e70899c6\" />|<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"tex_lanczos\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bff9092f-90d0-41b2-9aa7-2c50258fb07d\" />|\r\n\r\n(I don't known why the cubic scaling in GIMP is different from Godot's. I can't find any other issues with Godot's implementation)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url